{'symbol': 'MKC', 'date': '2021-09-20 08:00:00', 'title': 'MCCORMICK & COMPANY ANNOUNCED AS GLOBAL COMPACT LEAD', 'text': 'HUNT VALLEY, MD., SEPT. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MCCORMICK & COMPANY, INCORPORATED (NYSE:MKC), A GLOBAL LEADER IN FLAVOR, ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS OFFICIALLY BEEN NAMED A GLOBAL COMPACT LEAD COMPANY BY THE UNITED NATIONS FOR ITS ONGOING COMMITMENT TO THE UN GLOBAL COMPACT AND ITS TEN PRINCIPLES FOR RESPONSIBLE BUSINESS.'}